ModifierHauntedWolf.Name: Haunted Wolf
ModifierHauntedWolf.Blurb: A fleeting phantom of the beast
ModifierHauntedWolf.Summary: An add-on for crew roles. Team-judging roles like the Sheriff see you as an impostor.
