ModifierHawk.Duration: Hawk Eye duration
ModifierHawk.Magnification: Zoom-out factor
ModifierHawk.CannotWalk: Can't walk while active
# ── ルーラー (RulerModifier) ──
RulerModifier.Name: Ruler
RulerModifier.Blurb: Obey me
RulerModifier.Summary: An add-on for impostors. Once, you can turn a nearby player into a Madmate.
