Spelunker.Name: Spelunker
Spelunker.Blurb: Dies at the slightest thing
Spelunker.Summary: A very frail neutral. Approaching vents, riding the lift, climbing ladders or opening doors may kill them, and long comms or lights sabotage kills them.
