ModifierSpelunker.Name: Frail
ModifierSpelunker.Blurb: Dies at the slightest thing
ModifierSpelunker.Summary: A very frail add-on. Approaching vents, riding the lift, climbing ladders or opening doors may kill them, and long comms or lights sabotage kills them.
ModifierSpelunker.SabotageDeath: Die when a sabotage drags on
ModifierSpelunker.CommsTime: Time until death in comms
ModifierSpelunker.LightsTime: Time until death in lights
