# ── ジャンボ (JumboModifier) ──
JumboModifier.Name: Jumbo
JumboModifier.Blurb: Grow big
JumboModifier.Summary: A modifier whose body keeps growing over time. Your growth shows next to your name.
JumboModifier.OnImpostor: Can attach to impostors
JumboModifier.OnNeutral: Can attach to neutrals
JumboModifier.GrowSeconds: Time to fully grow
JumboModifier.GrowInMeeting: Grow during meetings

# ── 選挙管理委員 (ElectionCommissioner) ──
ElectionCommissioner.Name: Election Commissioner
ElectionCommissioner.Blurb: Watch every honest vote
ElectionCommissioner.Summary: A crewmate who can see who voted for whom, even with anonymous votes.
# ── ハンバーガー屋 (HamburgerShop) ──
HamburgerShop.Name: Hamburger Shop
HamburgerShop.Blurb: Welcome, what'll it be?
HamburgerShop.Summary: A crewmate with no abilities.
# ── ボディービルダー (BodyBuilder) ──
BodyBuilder.Name: Body Builder
BodyBuilder.Blurb: Behold these muscles!
BodyBuilder.Summary: A crewmate who can strike a pose after finishing all tasks.
BodyBuilder.Pose: Pose
BodyBuilder.Pose.Help: Usable after all tasks are done. Shows 💪 by your name for everyone for a while.
BodyBuilder.Pose.Short: Show off your muscles
BodyBuilder.Cooldown: Pose cooldown
# ── ジャンプダンサー (JumpDancer) ──
JumpDancer.Name: Jump Dancer
JumpDancer.Blurb: Everybody jump!
JumpDancer.Summary: A crewmate who can make themselves and nearby players jump (visual only).
JumpDancer.Jump: Jump!
JumpDancer.Jump.Help: You and nearby players hop for a moment (visual only).
JumpDancer.Jump.Short: Jump with those nearby
JumpDancer.Cooldown: Jump cooldown
JumpDancer.Range: Jump range
