NiceRedRidingHood.Name: Nice Red Riding Hood
NiceRedRidingHood.Blurb: Back from the wolf's belly
NiceRedRidingHood.Summary: A crewmate who comes back to life after the next meeting once their killer dies.
NiceRedRidingHood.Revives: Revives
# ── ナイスサイエンティスト (NiceScientist) ──
NiceScientist.Name: Nice Scientist
NiceScientist.Blurb: The invisible researcher
NiceScientist.Summary: A crewmate who can turn invisible for a while.
NiceScientist.Hide: Invisibility
NiceScientist.Hide.Help: Turns you invisible for a set time. You can still be targeted by abilities.
NiceScientist.Hide.Short: Turn invisible for a while
NiceScientist.Cooldown: Invisibility cooldown
NiceScientist.Duration: Invisibility duration
# ── イビルサイエンティスト (EvilScientist) ──
EvilScientist.Name: Evil Scientist
EvilScientist.Blurb: The invisible researcher
EvilScientist.Summary: An impostor who can turn invisible for a while.
EvilScientist.Hide: Invisibility
EvilScientist.Hide.Help: Turns you invisible for a set time. You can still be targeted by abilities.
EvilScientist.Hide.Short: Turn invisible for a while
EvilScientist.Cooldown: Invisibility cooldown
EvilScientist.Duration: Invisibility duration

# ── 警察医 (PoliceSurgeon) ──
PoliceSurgeon.Name: Police Surgeon
PoliceSurgeon.Blurb: The estimated time of death is...
PoliceSurgeon.Summary: A crewmate who learns how long ago each victim died when a meeting starts.
PoliceSurgeon.Error: Time error
PoliceSurgeon.Title: [Estimated time of death]
PoliceSurgeon.Line: {name}: about {s}s ago
# ── サイコメトラー (Psychometrist) ──
Psychometrist.Name: Psychometrist
Psychometrist.Blurb: Read the memories of the dead
Psychometrist.Summary: A crewmate who can read a body's cause of death and how long ago it died.
Psychometrist.Read: Read
Psychometrist.Read.Help: Examines a nearby body and posts its cause of death and time (with error) to chat.
Psychometrist.Read.Short: Read a body
Psychometrist.Cooldown: Read cooldown
Psychometrist.Error: Time error
Psychometrist.Result: {name}: {cause} / about {s}s ago
Psychometrist.Killed: killed
Psychometrist.Suicide: suicide
# ── 遺言伝達者 (DyingMessenger) ──
DyingMessenger.Name: Dying Messenger
DyingMessenger.Blurb: Hear their last words
DyingMessenger.Summary: A crewmate who learns the killer's role by reporting a fresh body.
DyingMessenger.Within: Time window
DyingMessenger.Message: {name}'s last words: the killer is {role}
# ── サンタ (Santa) ──
Santa.Name: Santa
Santa.Blurb: Presents for good kids
Santa.Summary: A crewmate who can give a nearby player a random crew role. If they aren't crew, you die.
Santa.Gift: Present
Santa.Gift.Help: Gives a nearby player a random crew role. If they aren't crew, you die.
Santa.Gift.Short: Give a role
Santa.Cooldown: Present cooldown
Santa.Uses: Presents
# ── ブラックサンタ (BlackSanta) ──
BlackSanta.Name: Black Santa
BlackSanta.Blurb: Presents for good kids
BlackSanta.Summary: A crewmate on the impostors' side who can give an impostor a random impostor role. If they aren't an impostor, you die.
BlackSanta.Gift: Present
BlackSanta.Gift.Help: Gives a nearby impostor a random impostor role. If they aren't an impostor, you die.
BlackSanta.Gift.Short: Give a role
BlackSanta.Cooldown: Present cooldown
BlackSanta.Uses: Presents
BlackSanta.CanVent: Can use vents
BlackSanta.ImpostorVision: Has impostor vision
BlackSanta.KnowImpostors: Can know the impostors
BlackSanta.NeededTasks: Tasks needed to know them
BlackSanta.WinCond: Win when the impostors win, dead or alive
# ── シルバーバレット (SilverBullet) ──
SilverBullet.Name: Silver Bullet
SilverBullet.Blurb: Traces never lie
SilverBullet.Summary: A crewmate who can check how many times a vent was used last round.
SilverBullet.Analyze: Analyze
SilverBullet.Analyze.Help: Checks a nearby vent and posts how many times it was used last round.
SilverBullet.Analyze.Short: Check a vent's use count
SilverBullet.Cooldown: Analyze cooldown
SilverBullet.Result: This vent was used {n} time(s) last round
# ── イカ (Squid) ──
Squid.Name: Squid
Squid.Blurb: Spray ink and run
Squid.Summary: A crewmate who, while on guard, blocks a kill and blinds the killer.
Squid.Guard: Guard
Squid.Guard.Help: Stay on guard for a set time. If attacked meanwhile, you block the kill, blind the killer for a while and get a speed boost.
Squid.Guard.Short: Block a kill and spray ink
Squid.Cooldown: Guard cooldown
Squid.Duration: Guard duration
Squid.InkTime: Blind duration
Squid.BoostTime: Speed boost duration
# ── タスクマスター (Taskmaster) ──
Taskmaster.Name: Taskmaster
Taskmaster.Blurb: Tasks done in an instant
Taskmaster.Summary: A crewmate who finishes a task just by opening it.
# ── ベントトラッパー (VentTrapper) ──
VentTrapper.Name: Vent Trapper
VentTrapper.Blurb: The trap is already set
VentTrapper.Summary: A crewmate who traps vents. Anyone else who enters a trapped vent dies.
VentTrapper.Trap: Trap!
VentTrapper.Trap.Help: Traps a nearby vent. Anyone else who enters it dies (the trap is used up).
VentTrapper.Trap.Short: Trap a vent
VentTrapper.Cooldown: Trap cooldown
VentTrapper.Uses: Traps
# ── データハッカー (Datahacker) ──
Datahacker.Name: Datahacker
Datahacker.Blurb: Expose all the data
Datahacker.Summary: A crewmate who learns the enemies after enough tasks, but is exposed to them a bit earlier.
Datahacker.NeededTasks: Tasks needed to see enemies
Datahacker.ExposeTasks: Tasks at which enemies see you

