Crab.Name: Crab
Crab.Blurb: Welcome to the sideways world
Crab.Summary: An impostor who can make everyone walk only sideways for a while.
Crab.Crab: Crab
Crab.Crab.Help: For a set time, everyone can only walk sideways.
Crab.Crab.Short: Make everyone walk sideways
Crab.Cooldown: Crab cooldown
Crab.Duration: Crab duration
