Doppelganger.Name: Doppelganger
Doppelganger.Blurb: Your other self
Doppelganger.Summary: An impostor who can take another's look. Killing that person shortens the next cooldown.
Doppelganger.Morph: Morph
Doppelganger.Morph.Help: Takes the chosen player's look for a set time.
Doppelganger.Morph.Short: Disguise as someone
Doppelganger.Cooldown: Morph cooldown
Doppelganger.Duration: Morph duration
Doppelganger.BonusCooldown: Cooldown after killing your look-alike
