DoubleKiller.Name: Double Killer
DoubleKiller.Blurb: The dual-wielding killer
DoubleKiller.Summary: An impostor with two kill buttons on separate cooldowns.
DoubleKiller.Kill: Kill (2)
DoubleKiller.Kill.Help: Kills a nearby player, separately from the normal kill button.
DoubleKiller.Kill.Short: A second kill
DoubleKiller.Cooldown: Second kill cooldown
