EvilHacker.Name: Evil Hacker
EvilHacker.Blurb: Every room is an open book
EvilHacker.Summary: An impostor who can view the admin map anywhere, anytime.
EvilHacker.Admin: Admin
EvilHacker.Admin.Help: Opens the admin map (player counts per room).
EvilHacker.Admin.Short: View admin anywhere
# ── ジャマー (Jammer) ──
Jammer.Name: Jammer
Jammer.Blurb: Invisible prey
Jammer.Summary: An impostor who can make a nearby player invisible to others for a while.
Jammer.Jam: Jam
Jammer.Jam.Help: Makes a nearby player invisible for a set time. They and impostors still see them.
Jammer.Jam.Short: Make someone invisible
Jammer.Cooldown: Jam cooldown
Jammer.Duration: Jam duration
# ── ネコカボチャ (NekoKabocha) ──
NekoKabocha.Name: Neko Kabocha
NekoKabocha.Blurb: I won't go alone
NekoKabocha.Summary: An impostor who takes their killer down when killed, or a random player when exiled.
# ── オーバーキラー (OverKiller) ──
OverKiller.Name: Over Killer
OverKiller.Blurb: Way overkill
OverKiller.Summary: An impostor whose victims leave several bodies around.
OverKiller.ExtraBodies: Extra bodies
# ── 追跡者 (Pursuer) ──
Pursuer.Name: Pursuer
Pursuer.Blurb: Follow the prey's scent
Pursuer.Summary: An impostor with an arrow pointing to the nearest non-impostor.
# ── 泥棒 (Robber) ──
Robber.Name: Robber
Robber.Blurb: I'll take that hard work
Robber.Summary: An impostor who undoes their victims' task progress.
# ── 侍 (Samurai) ──
Samurai.Name: Samurai
Samurai.Blurb: One clean cut
Samurai.Summary: An impostor who can once slay every crewmate around them.
Samurai.Slash: Special Move
Samurai.Slash.Help: Kills everyone around you except impostors (once per game).
Samurai.Slash.Short: Slay everyone nearby
Samurai.Range: Range
# ── 自爆魔 (SelfBomber) ──
SelfBomber.Name: Self Bomber
SelfBomber.Blurb: You're all coming with me!
SelfBomber.Summary: An impostor who can blow up, killing themselves and every crewmate nearby.
SelfBomber.Bomb: Self-Destruct
SelfBomber.Bomb.Help: You die, along with everyone around you except impostors.
SelfBomber.Bomb.Short: Blow up with those nearby
SelfBomber.Range: Blast range
# ── スラッガー (Slugger) ──
Slugger.Name: Slugger
Slugger.Blurb: Knock 'em out of the park!
Slugger.Summary: An impostor who knocks nearby players away, leaving no bodies.
Slugger.Swing: Harisen
Slugger.Swing.Help: Knocks away everyone around you except impostors. No bodies are left.
Slugger.Swing.Short: Knock everyone away
Slugger.Cooldown: Harisen cooldown
Slugger.Range: Range
# ── シフトアクター (ShiftActor) ──
ShiftActor.Name: Shift Actor
ShiftActor.Blurb: I'll play that part perfectly
ShiftActor.Summary: An impostor who can take another's look and learn their role.
ShiftActor.Morph: Morph
ShiftActor.Morph.Help: Takes the chosen player's look for a set time and posts their role to chat.
ShiftActor.Morph.Short: Disguise and learn their role
ShiftActor.Cooldown: Morph cooldown
ShiftActor.Duration: Morph duration
ShiftActor.Role: {name}'s role: {role}
# ── サイドキラー (SideKiller) ──
SideKiller.Name: Side Killer
SideKiller.Blurb: Become my right hand
SideKiller.Summary: An impostor who can once turn a nearby player into a Mad Killer.
SideKiller.Convert: Corrupt
SideKiller.Convert.Help: Turns a nearby player into a Mad Killer (once). When you die, they become an impostor.
SideKiller.Convert.Short: Make someone a Mad Killer
SideKiller.Cooldown: Corrupt cooldown
# ── マッドキラー (MadKiller) ──
MadKiller.Name: Mad Killer
MadKiller.Blurb: Inherit my master's will
MadKiller.Summary: A crewmate on the impostors' side made by the Side Killer. Becomes an impostor when the Side Killer dies.
MadKiller.WinCond: Win when the impostors win, dead or alive
# ── 眷属 (VampireDependent) ──
VampireDependent.Name: Vampire Dependent
VampireDependent.Blurb: Darkness is my domain
VampireDependent.Summary: An impostor made by a Vampire. Optionally has reverse vision, and dies with the Vampire.

# ── クノイチ (Kunoichi) ──
Kunoichi.Name: Kunoichi
Kunoichi.Blurb: A throw from the shadows
Kunoichi.Summary: An impostor who can't kill normally but kills by hitting the same person with enough kunai. Can turn invisible by standing still.
Kunoichi.Kunai: Kunai
Kunoichi.Kunai.Help: Throw a kunai toward the mouse (only you see it). Hitting the same person enough times kills them.
Kunoichi.Kunai.Short: Throw kunai
Kunoichi.Cooldown: Kunai cooldown
# ── トリガーハッピー (TriggerHappy) ──
TriggerHappy.Name: Trigger Happy
TriggerHappy.Blurb: Shoot, shoot, and keep shooting
TriggerHappy.Summary: An impostor who sprays a machine gun for a while and kills anyone hit by enough bullets.
TriggerHappy.Spray: Spray
TriggerHappy.Spray.Help: Hold a machine gun for a while and keep spraying bullets toward the mouse. Anyone hit enough times dies. Bullets stop at walls (unless set to pierce) and bounce off a Wise Man's barrier.
TriggerHappy.Spray.Short: Spray the machine gun
TriggerHappy.Cooldown: Spray cooldown
TriggerHappy.Range: Bullet range
# ── 波動砲 (WaveCannon) ──
WaveCannon.Name: Wave Cannon
WaveCannon.Blurb: A light that pierces all
WaveCannon.Summary: An impostor who sets up a cannon, charges it, and fires a beam sideways. Anyone hit dies regardless of team.
WaveCannon.Beam: Wave Cannon
WaveCannon.Beam.Help: Set up a cannon and stand still; when charged, fire a wall-piercing beam (Tank) or charging Santas (Santa) to the side you face. Anyone hit dies regardless of team. A Wise Man's barrier stops and reflects the beam.
WaveCannon.Beam.Short: Charge and fire sideways
WaveCannon.Cooldown: Wave cannon cooldown
# ── ヴァンパイア (Vampire) ──
Vampire.Name: Vampire
Vampire.Blurb: It takes effect slowly
Vampire.Summary: An impostor whose victims die after a delay, leaving a trail of blood. Can create a dependent.
Vampire.Delay: Seconds until the bitten die
# ── マトリョーシカ (Matryoshka) ──
Matryoshka.Name: Matryoshka
Matryoshka.Blurb: Someone else inside
Matryoshka.Summary: An impostor who wears nearby bodies to take their look. Each wear lengthens the kill cooldown.
Matryoshka.Wear: Wear
Matryoshka.Wear.Help: Wear a nearby body to take that person's look (the body comes with you). When time runs out or you press again, you drop it there. A meeting also makes you take it off.
Matryoshka.Wear.Short: Wear a body as a disguise
Matryoshka.Cooldown: Wear cooldown
Matryoshka.Duration: Wear duration
# ── ペンギン (Penguin) ──
Penguin.Name: Penguin
Penguin.Blurb: Come along for a bit
Penguin.Summary: An impostor who grabs a nearby player, drags them along, and kills them when time is up.
Penguin.Grab: Abduct
Penguin.Grab.Help: Grabs a nearby player and drags them along. Kill them with the kill button or when time runs out.
Penguin.Grab.Short: Grab, drag, and kill
Penguin.Cooldown: Abduct cooldown
Penguin.Duration: Grab duration
# ── ロケット (Rocket) ──
Rocket.Name: Rocket
Rocket.Blurb: Tamaya!
Rocket.Summary: An impostor who grabs a player and launches them into the sky. No body is left.
Rocket.Grab: Grab
Rocket.Grab.Help: Grabs a nearby player and drags them for a set time.
Rocket.Grab.Short: Grab a nearby player
Rocket.Cooldown: Grab cooldown
Rocket.Launch: Launch
Rocket.Launch.Help: Launches the grabbed player into the sky. No body is left.
Rocket.Launch.Short: Launch the grabbed player
Rocket.Duration: Grab duration
# ── 魔術師 (Conjurer) ──
Conjurer.Name: Conjurer
Conjurer.Blurb: No escape inside the triangle
Conjurer.Summary: An impostor who places three markers and kills everyone inside the triangle. Cannot kill normally.
Conjurer.Mark: Marker
Conjurer.Mark.Help: Place a marker where you stand (only you see it). From the second one, it must be within the set distance of the previous one. Up to 3; they vanish at meetings.
Conjurer.Mark.Short: Place a marker
Conjurer.MarkCooldown: Marker cooldown
Conjurer.Crush: Activate
Conjurer.Crush.Help: Kills everyone inside the triangle of your 3 markers (impostors too if set).
Conjurer.Crush.Short: Kill all inside the triangle
# ── ディメンションウォーカー (DimensionWalker) ──
DimensionWalker.Name: Dimension Walker
DimensionWalker.Blurb: One who walks between dimensions
DimensionWalker.Summary: An impostor who places wormholes that become linked vents after a while.
DimensionWalker.Place: Place / Collect
DimensionWalker.Place.Help: Place a wormhole at your feet (not near doors). After the set time it becomes a vent linked to your other wormholes (anyone who can vent may use it). Impostors see the time left. Press while your vent button targets one of your wormholes to collect it and get the use back.
DimensionWalker.Place.Short: Place or collect a wormhole
DimensionWalker.Cooldown: Place cooldown

# ── 波動砲ジャッカル (WaveCannonJackal) ──
WaveCannonJackal.Name: Wave Cannon Jackal
WaveCannonJackal.Blurb: The pack's cannon
WaveCannonJackal.Summary: A Jackal-pack member with a kill button and a Wave Cannon.
WaveCannonJackal.Kill: Kill
WaveCannonJackal.Kill.Help: You can kill anyone outside the Jackal pack. Win when only the pack remains.
WaveCannonJackal.Kill.Short: Kill outside the pack
WaveCannonJackal.Beam: Wave Cannon
WaveCannonJackal.Beam.Help: Set up a cannon, charge, and fire a wall-piercing beam or Santas sideways. Anyone hit dies, including allies. A Wise Man's barrier reflects it.
WaveCannonJackal.Beam.Short: Charge and fire sideways
WaveCannonJackal.Cooldown: Wave cannon cooldown
WaveCannonJackal.Sidekick: Sidekick
WaveCannonJackal.Sidekick.Help: Turn a nearby player into an ally of the set kind (once).
WaveCannonJackal.Sidekick.Short: Recruit a nearby player
