SidekickWaveCannon.Name: Wave Cannon Sidekick
SidekickWaveCannon.Blurb: Heir to the cannon
SidekickWaveCannon.Summary: Recruited by the Wave Cannon Jackal. Becomes one when no Wave Cannon Jackal is left alive.
