LoversBreaker.Name: Lovers Breaker
LoversBreaker.Blurb: Down with happy couples
LoversBreaker.Summary: A neutral who wins alone by blowing up the Lovers until none are left.
LoversBreaker.Blast: Blast
LoversBreaker.Blast.Help: Kills a nearby player if they are a Lover. If not, you die instead.
LoversBreaker.Blast.Short: Blow up a Lover
LoversBreaker.Cooldown: Blast cooldown
LoversBreaker.NeededBlasts: Blasts needed to win
