FalseCharges.Frame.Help: Frames a nearby player and you die. Win if they are exiled within a set number of meetings.
FalseCharges.Frame.Short: Frame someone and die
FalseCharges.Meetings: Meetings allowed for the exile
# ── 陰陽師 (OrientalShaman) ──
OrientalShaman.Name: Oriental Shaman
OrientalShaman.Blurb: Seeing through the wicked
OrientalShaman.Summary: A neutral who can see who can kill, and steals the win by surviving.
OrientalShaman.Servant: Shikigami
OrientalShaman.Servant.Help: Turns a nearby player into your Shikigami, who wins with you (once).
