# ── 式神 (ShermansServant) ──
ShermansServant.Name: Shikigami
ShermansServant.Blurb: For my master
ShermansServant.Summary: A servant made by the Oriental Shaman. Wins when the Shaman wins.
ShermansServant.Morph: Morph
ShermansServant.Morph.Help: Takes the Oriental Shaman's look for a set time.
ShermansServant.Morph.Short: Disguise as the Shaman
ShermansServant.Cooldown: Morph cooldown
