# ── フリーター (PartTimer) ──
PartTimer.Name: Part Timer
PartTimer.Blurb: Ride the winning horse
PartTimer.Summary: A neutral who picks an employer and wins with them if both survive.
PartTimer.Hire: Hire
PartTimer.Hire.Help: Makes a nearby player your employer. If they die, you can pick another.
PartTimer.Hire.Short: Pick an employer
PartTimer.Cooldown: Hire cooldown
# ── モイラ (Moira) ──
Moira.Name: Moira
Moira.Blurb: Weaver of fate
Moira.Summary: A neutral who swaps two players' roles during meetings. Steals the win by surviving after using them all.
Moira.Pick: Fate
Moira.Pick.Help: Pick two players in a meeting; their roles swap when it ends.
Moira.Pick.Short: Swap two players' roles
Moira.Swaps: Number of swaps
# ── シュレディンガーの猫 (SchrodingersCat) ──
SchrodingersCat.Name: Schrodinger's Cat
SchrodingersCat.Blurb: Alive, or dead?
SchrodingersCat.Summary: A neutral who, when attacked, survives and becomes a cat of the attacker's team.
# ── ブラックハットハッカー (BlackHatHacker) ──
BlackHatHacker.Name: Black Hat Hacker
BlackHatHacker.Blurb: The virus spreads quietly
BlackHatHacker.Summary: A neutral who spreads a virus and wins alone once everyone is infected.
BlackHatHacker.Hack: Hack
BlackHatHacker.Hack.Help: Infects a nearby player. Those near fully infected players slowly get infected too.
BlackHatHacker.Hack.Short: Infect with a virus
BlackHatHacker.Cooldown: Hack cooldown
BlackHatHacker.Uses: Hack uses
BlackHatHacker.Range: Spread range
BlackHatHacker.Seconds: Seconds nearby to be fully infected
# ── 金庫破り (Safecracker) ──
Safecracker.Name: Safecracker
Safecracker.Blurb: Every lock is open
Safecracker.Summary: A neutral who wins alone by finishing all their tasks, growing stronger as tasks progress.

# ── カンテラ (Cantera) ──
Cantera.Name: Cantera
Cantera.Blurb: Light your friends' way
Cantera.Summary: A ghost role for dead crewmates. Haunts someone to widen their sight for a while.
Cantera.Light: Lantern
Cantera.Light.Help: Haunts someone (even through walls) and sets their sight to a multiple of the ship's brightest for a while.
Cantera.Light.Short: Widen someone's sight
Cantera.Cooldown: Lantern cooldown
Cantera.Duration: Lantern duration
Cantera.Vision: Lantern vision
Cantera.Lit: Lantern
# ── ゴーストメカニック (GhostMechanic) ──
GhostMechanic.Name: Ghost Mechanic
GhostMechanic.Blurb: Fix the ship even in death
GhostMechanic.Summary: A ghost role for dead crewmates. Fixes active sabotages.
GhostMechanic.Repair: Repair
GhostMechanic.Repair.Help: Instantly fixes every active sabotage. Settings can stop it fixing Mushroom Mixup.
GhostMechanic.Repair.Short: Fix sabotages
# ── レヴェナント (Revenant) ──
Revenant.Name: Revenant
Revenant.Blurb: Take your revenge
Revenant.Summary: A ghost bound by the Necromancer. Each time it finishes its ghost tasks it can haunt a living crewmate and take their sight.
# ── ミラージュ (Mirage) ──
Mirage.Name: Mirage
Mirage.Blurb: Confuse them with phantom bodies
Mirage.Summary: A ghost role for dead impostors. Places copies of bodies. The screen flashes when someone dies.
Mirage.Copy: Phantom
Mirage.Copy.Help: Places a copy of one of the existing bodies where you are. The screen flashes cyan when someone dies.
Mirage.Copy.Short: Place a copy of a body

