ModifierGuesser.Shoot: Shoot
ModifierGuesser.Shoot.Help: In a meeting, pick a player and guess their role. If right, they die; if wrong, you die.
ModifierGuesser.Shoot.Short: Guess a role and shoot
ModifierGuesser.Shots: Total shots
ModifierGuesser.PerMeeting: Shots per meeting

# ── ドアー (Doorr) ──
Doorr.Name: Doorr
Doorr.Blurb: Doors are my friends
Doorr.Summary: A crewmate who can open and close the door in front of them.
Doorr.Door: Doooor!!
Doorr.Door.Help: Closes a nearby open door, or opens a closed one. Only on maps with openable doors.
Doorr.Door.Short: Toggle the nearby door
Doorr.Cooldown: Door cooldown
# ── イビルドアー (EvilDoorr) ──
EvilDoorr.Name: Evil Doorr
EvilDoorr.Blurb: Let me lock you in
EvilDoorr.Summary: A impostor who can open and close the door in front of them.
EvilDoorr.Door: Doooor!!
EvilDoorr.Door.Help: Closes a nearby open door, or opens a closed one. Only on maps with openable doors.
EvilDoorr.Door.Short: Toggle the nearby door
EvilDoorr.Cooldown: Door cooldown

# ── バスカー (Busker) ──
Busker.Name: Busker
Busker.Blurb: Playing dead is part of the act
Busker.Summary: A crewmate who can fake their death and come back later.
Busker.Fake: Pseudocide
Busker.Fake.Help: Leaves your body and turns you into a ghost. Press again to come back where you are (only while the body remains and you are inside the map). If time runs out, a meeting starts, or the body disappears, you really die.
