Busker.Reborn: Reborn
Busker.Cooldown: Pseudocide cooldown
Busker.Duration: Time until real death
# ── ナイスメカニック (NiceMechanic) ──
NiceMechanic.Name: Nice Mechanic
NiceMechanic.Blurb: Let me move this vent a little
NiceMechanic.Summary: A crewmate who can become a vent and carry it around.
NiceMechanic.Move: Relocate
NiceMechanic.Move.Help: Turns you into a nearby vent and lets you carry it for a while (press again to put it down). Nobody can enter it while it moves. Its connections stay the same.
NiceMechanic.Move.Short: Carry a vent
NiceMechanic.Cooldown: Relocate cooldown
NiceMechanic.Duration: Relocate duration
# ── イビルメカニック (EvilMechanic) ──
EvilMechanic.Name: Evil Mechanic
EvilMechanic.Blurb: Vents go where I want
EvilMechanic.Summary: A impostor who can become a vent and carry it around.
EvilMechanic.Move: Relocate
EvilMechanic.Move.Help: Turns you into a nearby vent and lets you carry it for a while (press again to put it down). Nobody can enter it while it moves. Its connections stay the same.
EvilMechanic.Move.Short: Carry a vent
EvilMechanic.Cooldown: Relocate cooldown
EvilMechanic.Duration: Relocate duration
