Tasker.Name: Tasker
Tasker.Blurb: Take the ship by doing tasks
Tasker.Summary: An impostor who can do real tasks. Finishing all of them while alive wins for the impostors.
Tasker.Tasks: Tasks
Tasker.Tasks.Help: You can use task consoles. Finishing all your tasks while alive wins for the impostors. Settings can stop you from killing, or freeze your kill cooldown while a task is open.
