Necromancer.Name: Necromancer
Necromancer.Blurb: Dead, obey me
Necromancer.Summary: An impostor who sees ghosts and can turn them into Revenants.
Necromancer.Curse: Bind
Necromancer.Curse.Help: Turns a nearby ghost into a Revenant. Each time it finishes its ghost tasks, a Revenant can haunt a living crewmate, taking their sight and stopping reports. Arrows show where your Revenants are.
