Necromancer.RevenantCannotReport: Revenant: haunted cannot report
# ── レヴェナント (Revenant) ──
Revenant.Haunt: Haunt
Revenant.Haunt.Help: Usable once each time you finish all your ghost tasks. Haunts a living crewmate for a while, shrinking their sight and stopping reports and emergency meetings. Ends when a meeting ends. Arrows show where the Necromancer is.
Revenant.Haunt.Short: Haunt a crewmate
Revenant.Haunted: Haunted
