Medium.Talk.Help: Only during Spirit Sight. A nearby ghost tells you one of: its killer's role, whether its killer's color is light or dark, the room it died in, or its own role. The answer appears in chat at the next meeting. Using it ends Spirit Sight.
Medium.Talk.Short: Hear from a ghost
Medium.Cooldown: Spirit Sight cooldown
Medium.Duration: Spirit Sight duration
Medium.TalkMaxUses: Spirit Talk uses
Medium.VisionActive: Spirit Sight
