Banshee.Summary: An impostor who kills whoever comes close to the person carrying her fairy.
Banshee.Release: Release
Banshee.Release.Help: Puts a fairy on a nearby person. The fairy jumps to whoever comes close to its holder. The holder is marked ✧.
Banshee.Release.Short: Release the fairy
