Pteranodon.Summary: A crewmate who can fly across the gap without the lift (Airship only).
Pteranodon.Fly: Fly
Pteranodon.Fly.Help: Next to a gap platform landing, flies you to the other side.
Pteranodon.Fly.Short: Fly across the gap
