RocketLauncher.Load.Short: Grab a crewmate
RocketLauncher.Shot: Launch
RocketLauncher.Shot.Help: Launches the grabbed person the way you face. On hitting a wall (or a person, by setting) they explode, killing those nearby. If a meeting starts, the held or flying person dies.
