# ── 突き落と師 (Pusher) ──
Pusher.Name: Pusher
Pusher.Blurb: Watch your step
Pusher.Summary: An impostor who pushes people standing at the ship's edges or atop ladders (Skeld, Polus, Airship, Fungle).
Pusher.Push: Push
Pusher.Push.Help: Pushes a crewmate standing at a ship edge (fixed spots). They fall and leave no body. Pushing someone atop a ladder leaves their body at the bottom.
Pusher.Push.Short: Push someone off an edge
Pusher.Cooldown: Push cooldown
# ── オルフェウス (Orpheus) ──
Orpheus.Name: Orpheus
Orpheus.Blurb: Bring your friends back from the underworld
Orpheus.Summary: An impostor who revives dead fellow impostors from ritual bodies.
Orpheus.Revive: Revive
Orpheus.Revive.Help: When a fellow impostor dies, a "ritual body" appears somewhere on the ship after each meeting (for a set number of meetings). Use this next to it and that impostor comes back with their role after the next meeting. Ritual bodies can only be reported up close; once reported, that impostor can no longer be revived.
Orpheus.Revive.Short: Revive a fellow impostor
Orpheus.CorpseTurns: Meetings a ritual body appears
Orpheus.Cooldown: Revive cooldown
Orpheus.ReportPercent: Ritual body report distance
Orpheus.Banner: Someone's soul has been called back from the underworld...

# ── サウナー (Sauner) ──
Sauner.Name: Sauner
Sauner.Blurb: Time to get totonou
Sauner.Summary: A neutral who wins alone by going through the sauna, the shower and the open-air rest in order (Airship only).
Sauner.Stages: Get Totonou
Sauner.Stages.Help: Spend the set time in each room in order: sauna (lounge) → shower → open-air rest (viewing deck). Time does not pass outside the room or during meetings. An arrow points to the next room. Finish the open-air rest to win alone.
Sauner.Stages.Short: Sauna → shower → rest
Sauner.DarkroomTime: Sauna time
Sauner.ShowerTime: Shower time
Sauner.DeckTime: Open-air rest time
