SchrodingersCat.TeamImpostor: Impostor Cat
SchrodingersCat.TeamImpostor.Help: You win with the impostors. You can kill non-impostors, vent, and have impostor vision. You and the impostors know each other.
SchrodingersCat.TeamImpostor.Short: Win with the impostors
SchrodingersCat.TeamMadmate: Mad Cat
SchrodingersCat.TeamMadmate.Help: You win with the impostors (follows the Madmate settings).
