SchrodingersCat.TeamJackal: Jackal Cat
SchrodingersCat.TeamJackal.Help: You win with the Jackal. You can kill anyone outside the Jackal's team. You and the Jackal's team know each other.
SchrodingersCat.TeamJackal.Short: Win with the Jackal
