Safecracker.Unlock: Crack the Safe
Safecracker.Unlock.Help: Finish all your tasks to win alone. As you reach the set task percentages you gain: blocking kills (limited), reviving after ejection (limited), venting, impostor vision, and knowing the impostors.
Safecracker.Unlock.Short: Finish all tasks to win
