Bullet.Name: Bullet
Bullet.Blurb: Loaded into the cannon
Bullet.Summary: Made by a Wave Cannon Jackal. Load yourself into your parent's cannon to make a Super Wave Cannon that pierces Wise Men.
Bullet.Load: Load
Bullet.Load.Help: Use near your parent to load yourself into their cannon. It becomes ready at once; you stick to your parent while it charges and vanish when it fires. If your parent dies you may become a Jackal.
Bullet.Load.Short: Load into parent's cannon
Bullet.NoEmergencyText: Something is scary and I can't open the meeting...

