Vampire.Bite: Bite
Vampire.Bite.Help: Biting with the kill button makes the target die after a set time (or when a meeting is called). The bitten person drops blood as they walk, visible from the next meeting for a set number of meetings. Optionally you cannot fix lights or use devices, don't show on admin, and look alive on vitals (same for your dependent).
Vampire.Bite.Short: Bitten players die later
Vampire.NightFall: Night Fall
Vampire.NightFall.Help: Turn a nearby non-impostor into your dependent (once). They die when you die.
Vampire.NightFall.Short: Create a dependent
